      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MIGHTY HENRY (2) is better than last start when seventh (30.49) in a Grade 5 at this track over 515m. Form at this distance is sound. Has ability and looks hard to stop. TIGER TAILS (1) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind Zipping Gressier (23.15) in a Grade 5. Has the pace to be prominent. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to her name from five starts. Expected to feature again. CLOSING MODEL (3) turned spotting a big start finishing fourth (23.34) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Solid record at the distance winning three races. Cannot be taken lightly. SWIFT EDDY (4) is building a nice sequence of wins and will be thereabouts again.",
